OHOS: translate the text-companion export strings this port adds to
ScreenshotRecognitionFileExport/ScreenshotSaveAsFileDialog.

When an OCR result is exported alongside an HTML/Markdown file with a
companion .txt file, OHOS needs a second document-picker authorization (see
the imageeditingexportcontroller/screenshotpinnedwindow patches); these are
the user-facing messages for that second authorization and for the
temp-file-staging failure. All of them are new OHOS strings, so nothing in
this catalog is dropped.

